  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your devastating blows can knock your opponents to the ground.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Str 15, Wis 13, Power Attack, any ki feat that expends ki focus to inlict damage on an opponent.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> During any successful attack the character makes in which he expends his ki focus, the blow may knock the target creature prone. If the character hits a corporeal opponent the same size or smaller than himself while expending his ki focus, whether for this feat or for another, his opponent must succeed on a Relex save (DC = damage dealt) or be knocked lying 10 feet in a direction of the attacking character’s choice and fall prone. The character can only push the opponent in a straight line, and the opponent can’t move closer to the character than the square it started in. If an obstacle prevents the move, the opponent and the obstacle each take 1d6 points of damage, and the opponent stops in the space adjacent.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc112\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
